==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Zoroark|89}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Zoroark}}.
*'''Energy Crush''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Espeon|16}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

